820 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Director of Design \050Player\057Coach\051\nBuilt and lead product design practice from first design hire to team of three\054 establishing design systems\054 operations\054 and culture while maintaining player\055coach role on company\047s highest\055impact initiatives\056 Partner with C\055suite to set product strategy and design direction\056\n\nLed company\047s largest product initiative\054 redesigning the client experience to reduce support volume 25\045 by shifting strategy from \042better messaging\042 to \042proactive transparency\042 based on user research\nDesigned compliance infrastructure encoding 810 state\057service\055type legal requirements into systematic rules engine\054 eliminating manual checks and creating foundation for affidavit automation\nEstablished design systems strategy \050Atlas web\054 Compass mobile\051 enabling 40\045 faster feature development through systematic component libraries\054 design tokens\054 and collective ownership model\nBuilt team infrastructure from scratch\072 research repository\054 planning cadence\054 and critique rituals to support scale without slowing)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 821 0 R
     /Pg 807 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

