822 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Principal Product Designer\nPlayer\055coach role leading design for legal document workflows\056 Conducted deep user research\054 designed operational systems\054 and shipped features with measurable impact on quality and efficiency\056\050\nShipped operational improvements reducing affidavit error rates 37\045 through structured collaboration workflows between ops teams and process servers\nDesigned AI\055powered job creation tool\054 calibrating automation confidence thresholds and human\055in\055the\055loop review to achieve 87\045 acceptance rate and 95\045 accuracy \055 savings clients 10 minutes per job\nLed strategic research that redirected product roadmap \055 identified clients needed transparency over messaging\054 shifting entire product direction)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 823 0 R
     /Pg 807 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

