824 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Systematic Interface Design\nIntensive program focused on systematic design processes\054 visual hierarchy\054 and production\055grade interface craft\056\n2021\n\nDesign Thinking \046 Execution\nStrategic design methodology for translating business objectives into actionable design work\056\n2017\n\nSkills\n\nProduct Design\050User research and synthesis\054 interaction design\054 AI prototyping \050v0\054 Claude\054 Figma Make\051\054 data\055driven decision making\054 complex workflow design\n\nTechnical Fluency\050Claude Code\054 Next\056js\054 Vercel\054 GitHub workflows\054 HTML\057CSS\054 working knowledge of modern web architecture\n\nDesign Leadership\050Team building and management\054 design operations\054 cross\055functional collaboration\054 strategic planning\054 design systems governance\054 IC mentorship and growth)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 825 0 R
     /Pg 807 0 R
     /S /Span
